@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Module M6: Payments Endpoints

### PAY-01 List payments (Admin, Staff all; Customer own)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?method=upi&sort=payment_date&direction=desc&page=1&per_page=15
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PAY-02 Record payment against confirmed invoice (Admin, Staff)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "invoice_id": 2,
  "method": "upi",
  "amount": "500.00",
  "payment_date": "2026-10-31",
  "reference": "UPI-SETTLE-101",
  "note": "Partial settlement for confirmed invoice"
}

### PAY-03 Delete payment and reverse invoice balances (Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
